flowchart TD
  SRC[Source + Expanded Syntax] --> RES[Resolution]
  RES --> TC[Type Checking]
  TC --> TS[Trait Solving / Normalization]
  TS --> META[Opaque meta::Info Graph]
  META --> CE[Consteval Metaprogram]
  CE --> REIFY[Typed Reification]
  REIFY --> CHECK[Ordinary Rust Checks]
  CHECK --> BIN[Binary]
  CHECK --> RTP[Optional Runtime Projection]
